      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Often. A household up the hill pays for a delivery, then a tailor down here needs thread brought back. I write both errands down. Knowing a familiar face is useful; remembering what they actually asked for is better.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
